      "charge": "Each listed role ends with the present-tense assertion `Last-heading custody remains D-322.` Live COORD ends at D-327, HEAD is D-327's recording commit, basedOn.d327.role claims live last-heading custody, and the subject's purpose says basedOn.d327.role is the sole last-heading claimant. The four D-322 assertions are therefore false and mutually inconsistent with the candidate's own D-327 custody clauses.",
